    :VD5_pair ".uw = vzxt(" VT5 ".uh)" is imm_24_27=0b1110 & imm_22_23=0 & imm_21=0 & imm_18_20=0 & imm_16_17=0b10 & imm_13=0 & VT5 & imm_5_7=0b010 & VD5_pair {
        VD5_pair = HVX_zxt(VT5);
